# Project Context Rule

- This repository is a two-package monorepo: `backend/` (Fastify API) and `frontend/` (Vite React UI).
- Shared docs live at the repo root (`docs/`, `requirements/`, ADRs).
- Prioritize maintainable structure over rapid feature delivery.
- Keep implementation aligned with docs in `/docs`.
- Update docs and templates when introducing new patterns.
- Prefer API-first and event-ready design decisions.
- Backend feature modules live under `backend/src/<feature>/{domain,application,infrastructure,interface}`.
